🚀 1. Build Image (Dev PC)

Inside your FastAPI project folder:

docker build -t fastapi:latest .

Verify:

docker images

You should see:

fastapi   latest

📦 2. Save Image to File

Export it as .tar:

docker save -o fastapi.tar fastapi:latest

3. Transfer to Server
Using SCP:
scp fastapi.tar user@server:/home/user/

OR use:

WinSCP
USB drive
shared folder


📥 4. Load Image (Server)

SSH into your server:

docker load -i fastapi.tar

Check:

docker images


5. Run Container
docker run -d -p 8000:8000 \
  --name fastapi-service \
  fastapi:latest

or Add the below in docker compose.yaml at the end

fastapi:
    image: fastapi:latest
    container_name: fastapi
    hostname: fastapi
    networks: ['demo']
    restart: unless-stopped
    ports:
      - 8000:8000   # optional (remove in production if using proxy)


🌐 6. Test API

Open:

http://server-ip:8000

